   "sourceHash": "d4496eec76ba27099144c413de53ffe006d65fa73e44789a07799680f2fa7ce7",
   "text": "Opleiding van 20 nachten: Deluxe Villa, eenpersoonsbezetting, totaal ₹368,200 (₹18,410 × 20 nachten).",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
